  "visible_text": "PASS\nTHE CAUSEWAY RISES\nCHAMBER 07 / ARCHITECTURAL ACTUATION\nRead the rising chamber in 3D. Set the red extrusion, select the stair end that raises the far ledge, prime the correctly oriented blue launcher, ride its contact launch, and activate the terminal.\n3D\nCAUSEWAY\nFIRST-PERSON CHAMBER VIEW\nHEIGHT \u00b7 NORMAL \u00b7 CONTACT\nRED TILE\n3/3\nTRIPLE\nLEFT HIGH\nLAUNCH\nLAUNCHER-03 PRIMED\nPOSITION\nX 17.3 \u00b7 Y -1.0 \u00b7 Z 1.7\nREAD THE SOLID\nExtrusion changes support. The clicked stair end makes the high side. A primed block only acts on contact.\nWASD / ARROWS\nHold to walk and strafe across the changed support.\nDRAG THE VIEW\nMouse-look and click the coloured blocks, then click the reached terminal.\nABANDON CHAMBER\nPASS \u00b7 TERMINAL ACTIVATED\nTHE BLOCKS ARE FIXED; THEIR SUPPORT EFFECTS ARE NOT"
